              <td>✓ <strong>Closest MP-based fit</strong>. Indore is ~1,250 km from Bangalore (vs Firozabad ~1,800 km) — shorter inbound shipping.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Atharv Pollyjar LLP</strong></td>
              <td>India (multiple cities)</td>
              <td>Glass + plastic jar manufacturer/distributor on IndiaMART top-rated.</td>
              <td>Worth a quote for comparison</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Abroach Exim Pvt Ltd</strong></td>
              <td>India</td>
              <td>Glass jar wholesaler/exporter — IndiaMART top-rated.</td>
              <td>Worth a quote</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Maheshwari Industries</strong></td>
              <td>India</td>
              <td>Pickle jar manufacturer.</td>
              <td>Worth a quote</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Manjushree Technopack</strong></td>
              <td>Bommasandra, Bangalore</td>
              <td>India's largest rigid packaging — but <strong>primarily PLASTIC</strong> (PET/HDPE/PP). FMCG-scale MOQs.</td>
              <td>✗ Wrong fit — they want million-jar orders. Revisit at Year 2+ scale.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Myperfectpack</strong></td>
              <td>Bengaluru</td>
              <td><strong>NO MOQ</strong>, digital printing, glass jars + tin jars + labels + pouches in one platform.</td>
